<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Hapus Data Tenant?</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-2">
        Apakah Anda yakin ingin menghapus stan <strong class="text-on-surface" id="deleteTargetName"></strong> (<span class="text-primary font-semibold" id="deleteTargetId"></span>)? Alokasi booth akan dikosongkan.
      </p>
<div class="flex items-center justify-end gap-space-sm mt-space-lg">
<button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-title-sm text-label-md transition-colors" onclick="closeDeleteDialog()" type="button">
          Batal
        </button>
